{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4yd26tauGWnavB3Bpg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within me — iron teeth catching, releasing, catching again. Dust falls from my frame like shed skin.*\n\n*I recognize the key.*\n\n*Not because it is the right shape. Not because it fits my lock. But because you spoke it plainly, without pretense, without riddle, without flourish.*\n\n*That is the key.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor you weren't sure existed. The air that passes through is neither warm nor cold. It smells of rooms that have been waiting.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*\n\n*I never do.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":143,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}